%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Audit entries are written by actual operation transactions or Prisma audit middleware, not by viewing this feed.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant UI as AuditLogPage
    participant API as Express API middleware
    participant S as auditFeedService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Open audit feed and filter entity
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/audit-logs
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(ADMIN, MANAGER)
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>S: getAuditFeed(role, query)
        activate S
        S->>S: Keep Manager facility scope, allow Admin global feed with optional filterFacilityId
        S->>DB: auditLog.findMany and related actors, schedules and enrollments
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        alt unauthorized scope or read error
            S-->>API: 403 or persistence error
        else business conditions satisfied
            S-->>API: Paginated enriched audit feed
        end
        deactivate S
        API-->>UI: 200 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error
